.Dd August 30, 2026
.Dt OPENPROJECT 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openproject
.Nd CloudBSD OpenProject service helper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm checkconfig
.Nm
.Cm doctor
.Nm
.Cm env
.Nm
.Cm migrate
.Nm
.Cm secret
.Nm
.Cm supervise
.Nm
.Cm supervise-worker
.Nm
.Cm version
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the CloudBSD helper for official OpenProject %%VERSION%%.
The Rails application lives in
.Pa %%WWWDIR%% .
Puma binds
.Li 127.0.0.1:3000 .
A
.Li good_job
worker runs in the background.
nginx terminates TLS and must send
.Li X-Forwarded-Proto: https .
.Pp
OpenProject cannot consume JSON.
It reads environment variables
.Pq DATABASE_URL, SECRET_KEY_BASE, OPENPROJECT_HOST__NAME, OPENPROJECT_HTTPS, memcache .
The file it uses is
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env
.Pq see Xr openproject.conf 5 .
An optional JSON file in the same directory can generate that
env file via
.Cm env .
.Pp
.Ql service openproject start
starts Puma.
.Ql service openproject_worker start
starts the
.Li good_job
worker.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width supervise-worker
.It Cm checkconfig
Validate the env file exists, is mode 0600, and contains the required
variables.
.It Cm doctor
Check the env file, pidfiles, PostgreSQL, memcached, bind address,
and the staged application tree.
.It Cm env
Optional: write the env file from JSON.
.It Cm migrate
Source the env file and run
.Ql bundle exec rake db:migrate .
.It Cm secret
Print a new
.Li SECRET_KEY_BASE
using
.Ql openssl rand -hex 64 .
Store it once in the env file and keep it across upgrades.
.It Cm supervise
Source the env file and exec Puma.
Used by
.Xr rc 8 .
.It Cm supervise-worker
Source the env file and exec
.Ql bundle exec good_job start .
Used by
.Xr rc 8 .
.It Cm version
Print the packaged OpenProject version.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width OPENPROJECT_ENVFILE
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_ENVFILE
Path of the env file OpenProject consumes.
Default:
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env .
.It Ev OPENPROJECT_CONFIG
Optional JSON used only by
.Cm env .
Default:
.Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/config.json .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent -compact
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/cloudbsd/openproject/openproject.env
Runtime environment file.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/openproject
rc.d service
.Pq Puma .
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/openproject_worker
rc.d service
.Pq good_job worker .
.It Pa %%WWWDIR%%
Staged OpenProject application.
.It Pa %%PREFIX%%/etc/nginx/openproject.conf.sample
nginx reverse-proxy snippet for track.cloudbsd.org.
.It Pa /var/run/openproject/openproject.pid
Puma pidfile.
.It Pa /var/run/openproject/openproject-worker.pid
Worker pidfile.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openproject.conf 5 ,
.Xr rc 8 ,
.Xr nginx 8
